{"id": "housing-authority-cash-and-pension-reconciliations", "title": "The Housing Authority corrected a $5.4 million cash and expense error", "seconds": 43.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-28", "key": "6f5cc0ba925af111", "words": 131, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The Housing Authority’s early financial statements disagreed with its own ledger.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.51, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["FY2022", "Revised balances"], ["FY2023", "Recorded adjustments"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.39, 0.82, 1.08, 1.51, 1.99, 2.48, 2.63, 2.77, 2.93]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Auditors found errors recording two housing conversions.", "t0": 3.63, "t1": 6.22, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "f2022", "kicker": "Balances changed between drafts", "text": "Housing conversions", "mark": "Housing"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.69, 1.05, 1.43, 1.61, 1.91]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Then the next audit put dollar figures on a different set of errors.", "t0": 6.44, "t1": 9.34, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "f2023", "kicker": "The pension and cash corrections", "text": "Pension and cash", "mark": "Pension"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.28, 0.56, 0.84, 1.05, 1.35, 1.7, 1.81, 1.87, 2.16, 2.31, 2.4]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "Pension expense was overstated by $2.1 million.", "t0": 9.46, "t1": 12.47, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$2.1 million", "label": "The pension and cash corrections"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.33, 0.68, 0.81, 1.42, 1.6, 1.81, 2.07, 2.23, 2.52]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The cash and expense reconciliation error was $5.4 million.", "t0": 12.59, "t1": 16.2, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Pension expense", "$2.1m overstated"], ["Cash and expenses", "$5.4m understated"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.4, 0.5, 0.85, 1.57, 1.95, 2.17, 2.43, 2.66, 2.87, 3.13]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The Authority corrected the statements.", "t0": 16.32, "t1": 17.95, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Recorded adjustments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.53, 0.9, 0.99]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The next audit marked the old corrective action implemented.", "t0": 18.07, "t1": 20.63, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "f2024", "kicker": "The old finding closed as a new one opened", "text": "Corrective action", "mark": "Corrective"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.36, 0.65, 0.87, 0.99, 1.17, 1.59, 1.89]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "But a new finding described revised balances and extensive manual reconciliations.", "t0": 20.75, "t1": 25.07, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "f2024", "kicker": "The old finding closed as a new one opened", "text": "Revised balances", "mark": "Revised"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.22, 0.42, 0.85, 1.26, 1.68, 2.21, 2.33, 2.87, 3.22]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The FY2024 auditors recommended evaluating the accounting system.", "t0": 25.19, "t1": 29.31, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Accounting system"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.47, 0.71, 1.02, 1.52, 2.04, 2.57, 3.12, 3.23, 3.62]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Authority began rolling out a new financial system.", "t0": 29.53, "t1": 31.99, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "f2025", "kicker": "Which software actually went live", "text": "Financial system", "mark": "Financial"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.53, 0.86, 1.16, 1.3, 1.37, 1.52, 2.02]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Only the purchase-to-payment module had gone live.", "t0": 32.11, "t1": 34.37, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Partial installation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.39, 1.17, 1.48, 1.6, 1.81]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Management expected the other modules in fiscal 2027.", "t0": 34.49, "t1": 37.95, "shot": "s11", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["FY2026", "Purchase-to-payment"], ["FY2027", "Remaining modules planned"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.52, 0.95, 1.07, 1.28, 1.76, 1.9, 2.39, 2.74]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Acceptance records would show when that work finished.", "t0": 38.07, "t1": 40.53, "shot": "s12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Acceptance records"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.51, 0.84, 1.01, 1.3, 1.48, 1.65, 1.91]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 40.65, "t1": 42.79, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Balances changed between drafts", "b": "The pension and cash corrections", "o": "Which software actually went live"}, "look": "newsroom", "hook": "document"}